{
  "_comment": [
    "The ground loot's sounds (GroundLoot.cpp), Diablo IV's, kept in sources/groundLoot: played by our own sound",
    "engine (localTools/audio/buildAudio.py builds the bank). Flips and landings come from the drop, in the world (its",
    "echo, muffled behind a wall); the pickups are interface sounds; each beam loops its quality's sound for as long",
    "as it stands.",
    "Landings by tier: a white item the plain flip landing, green the magic halo, blue the rare one, epic the",
    "legendary/set one, an epic touched or a Unique the unique one, a legendary the mythic (uber unique) one."
